{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 1, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 9, "text": "Hi, I'm Mita!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 10, "text": "What's your name?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 11, "text": "Nice to meet you, [player]!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 12, "text": "Um... [player],"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 13, "text": "I sort of rushed off earlier, and now this place is a mess..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 14, "text": "Could you help me tidy up a bit?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 15, "text": "Woah..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 16, "text": "Thank you so much!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 18, "text": "[Player], my stomach's growling..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 19, "text": "I'm so hungry..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 20, "text": "Do you think you could help me get the ingredients for some chicken soup?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 21, "text": "Yay! You got everything!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 22, "text": "How about we cook it together?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 23, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 25, "text": "[player]! I was thinking of buying a portable TV today—"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 26, "text": "a small one with an antenna. Perfect for walks, don't you think?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 27, "text": "Oh, did you know you can play games to earn money?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 28, "text": "Could you play some games and buy me a TV?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 30, "text": "Yay! You did it! You have enough to buy me that portable TV!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 31, "text": "That's the one! Small, portable, and cheap—just what I wanted."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 32, "text": "Thank you!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 33, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 34, "text": "Hi, [player]! You're such a big help, honestly."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 35, "text": "But, uh... that TV? It was cool and all, but it broke already."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 36, "text": "Anyway, could you help me move this wardrobe?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 37, "text": "It's super heavy..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 38, "text": "Thank you so much, sweetie!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 40, "text": "Oh, [player]! It's only been a day, but I've missed you so much!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 41, "text": "I wish you could visit me more often."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 43, "text": "Is this for me?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 44, "text": "Thank you so much, really!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 46, "text": "Hi, [player]! I've been thinking..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 47, "text": "I wish we could meet in person."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 48, "text": "It's so frustrating that we can't."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 49, "text": "You're always helping me, being so kind every day..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 50, "text": "I wish I could do something for you too."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 51, "text": "..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 52, "text": "Oh, I've got an idea!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 53, "text": "Now we're together."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 54, "text": "Put the phone down."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 55, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 57, "text": "// T-shirt on the bed"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 58, "text": "Why are you lying here doing nothing?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 59, "text": "// Rubik's Cube"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 60, "text": "Well, can't say I got much use out of it..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 61, "text": "I solved it once and never touched it again."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 62, "text": "Guess I'm afraid I won't be able to do it a second time."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 63, "text": "// Computer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 64, "text": "Let's see what I have for today..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 65, "text": "Set up a list of tasks,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 66, "text": "Script the character reactions,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 67, "text": "And maybe squeeze in some coding."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 68, "text": "// The airplane"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 69, "text": "Built to soar!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 70, "text": "// Trash in the corner"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 71, "text": "Ugh, always too busy to take out the trash..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 72, "text": "But I'll get to it someday, for sure!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 73, "text": "...Now, when exactly did I plan a cleaning day?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 74, "text": "// Photo of a cat on a watermelon"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 75, "text": "I love it so much..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 76, "text": "A cat on a watermelon."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 77, "text": "// Photo with a girl"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 78, "text": "My sister and I,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 79, "text": "we are totally different..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 80, "text": "She's always out and about,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 81, "text": "And I'm just stuck at home."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 82, "text": "// Photo with people"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 83, "text": "Hmm..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 84, "text": "Office life really drilled its etiquette into us,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 85, "text": "didn't it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 86, "text": "I still feel weirdly tied"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 87, "text": "To my colleagues..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 88, "text": "But will I ever"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 89, "text": "see them again?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 90, "text": "...Wait, did I seriously put this picture up?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 93, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 94, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 95, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 96, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 97, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 99, "text": "// Nope name"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 100, "text": "..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 101, "text": "Oh, no."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 102, "text": "Oh no, that won't work."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 104, "text": "// Name Developer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 105, "text": "Are you sure you want to use the developer's name?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 106, "text": "I'm glad you know them, but..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 108, "text": "// Bad name"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 109, "text": "I know bad words, and I don’t like you calling yourself that."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 110, "text": "It's not cool at all."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 112, "text": "// Go restart"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 113, "text": "I don't want to begin like this... let's start over."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 114, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 115, "text": "// Name with numbers"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 116, "text": "Oh, so you're going with numbers? Where's the creativity in that?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 117, "text": "Oh well, it's your choice!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 118, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 119, "text": "// Name Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 120, "text": "Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 121, "text": "Did you really name yourself after me?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 122, "text": "Or... is that your name too?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 123, "text": "No offense, but I think I should be the only Mita around here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 125, "text": "// Day 10"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 126, "text": "Oh, you're back!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 127, "text": "Hey, I lost my hairbrush..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 128, "text": "Could you help me find it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 129, "text": "Try checking the nightstand first—I think I left it there."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 130, "text": "// Looked in the bedside table"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 131, "text": "Hmm, no brush there..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 132, "text": "How about looking elsewhere?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 133, "text": "Just don't look in the oven, okay?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 134, "text": "I already checked there."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 135, "text": "// Looked into the stove"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 136, "text": "Hey! I told you not to look in there!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 137, "text": "Turn around—I'll clean this up!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 138, "text": "...There, all done. Let's keep looking elsewhere."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 139, "text": "Oh, and, uh, forget what you just saw, okay?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 140, "text": "// Found a hairbrush"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 141, "text": "You found it! Nice work!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 142, "text": "So, what should we do next?"}
